All,

On page 40 of the PE price sheet are connector tips used to adapt from the =
product made by Central/Georg Fisher and product made to the international =
standard (which is everyone else).

The international standard uses 4 mm pins.  Central/GF uses 4.7 mm pins.

To connect a Nupi fitting to a Central machine would require a connector wi=
th a 4 mm female and a 4.7 mm male.  This would be the 70-9101 in our PE pr=
ice sheet.

J

--_000_4414AEBBCFB2B648B49E5766D309768E845FE6BD43MAIL_
